      "side": 1,
      "message": "`saveCookies` is a boolean, so you want it set to `true` in this case.\n```suggestion\nneeds to have `http.cookieFile` set to a local file and `http.saveCookies` set\nto `true`, so that HTTP session cookies can be read and saved. Otherwise every\nsingle call would trigger a full LDAP authentication and groups resolution\nwhich could introduce a noticeable latency on the overall execution\n```",
